  "code": "RCI_I05",
  "name": "Request for patient clinical information acknowledgement",
  "version": "HL7 v2.5.1",
  "chapter": "Patient Referral",
  "description": "This event is used to request clinical information for a specific patient.  Generally, this transaction occurs between one provider and another (typically a laboratory or radiology, etc.).  However, it may also be very useful for a payor-to-provider request for clinical observation information to be used in considering a request for treatment authorization.",
